<p>A lot of things have made their way through our kitchen over the years.</p>
<p>Some seemed like a good idea at the time and were forgotten a few weeks later. Others I reach for almost every day without giving them much thought.</p>
<p>If I had to set up my kitchen again from scratch, these are the things I’d buy again.</p>
<p>None of them are particularly new or exciting. There are no clever gadgets here, and certainly nothing that deserves cupboard space just because the internet told me I needed it.</p>
<p>They’re simply things that work — and have made cooking and running our kitchen a little easier over the years.</p>
